# The Python packaging rules above are unanchored, so `lib/` also matched the
# Next.js frontend's own source folder and silently excluded the whole API
# client. Re-include it explicitly (frontend/ has its own .gitignore for
# node_modules/.next/.env).
!frontend/src/lib/
